ar Bhan  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 18 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm oriented lumpectomy specimen  The external surface is tan yellow to tan pink and is inked anterior blue  posterior black  medial green  lateral yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal an ill defined firm tan white 1 0cm in greatest dimension stellate mass  The mass is 0 2cm from the lateral margin  0 4cm from the posterior margin  0 4cm from the medial margin  1 0cm from the anterior margin  1 3cm from the superior margin  and 0 8cm from the inferior margin  The entire specimen is submitted from superior to inferior in cassettes A J  with the mass in E H  and the closest margins to the mass in E F  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final deep left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm fragment of adipose tissue that is unoriented  The entire specimen is submitted in cassette K  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final anterior left breast  are 4 fragments of unoriented yellow adipose tissue  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes L M  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  inferior lateral left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of unoriented adipose tissue that is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes N O  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  superior medial  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm fragment of adipose tissue with 2 stitch demarcating the area furthest from tumor  The stitched side is inked black  the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes P Q  Resident  STEWART M  KNOEPP  MD   Ph D              